<title>USA: Grand Court number of shares reduced.</title>
<headline>Grand Court number of shares reduced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of shares proposed for the initial public offering in Grand Court Lifestyles Inc was reduced to 1.5 million shares from 2.6 million shares previously, the lead underwriter National Securities said on Monday.</p>
<p>The estimated target price of $10 has not changed. The initial public offering is expected to price and trade on Monday.</p>
<p>Grand Court manages adult living communities.</p>
</text>
